# Morrowind Daedric quests: Mephala's sensitive matter (DA_Mephala). Taros Dral, in the Arena's hidden area, asks
# for help ("sensitive matters": 10; "I would like to help." 1: 40, five treated bittergreen). In Balyn Omavel's
# house in Balmora the poison goes into his pot ("Yes." button 0: 50, poisonfoodScript), unseen at his door (else
# 55, balynScript). Taros Dral sends the player to Mephala's altar, which gives the Ring of Khajiit (60).
# PositionCell stands in for the travel. FormIDs carry Morrowind.esm's slot 05: 0573FA5E Balyn's pot, 05CD869D
# Mephala's altar.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_da_malacath_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case da_mephala_start
run
player->PositionCell -531 -450 -240 0 "Vivec, Arena Hidden Area"
until 600 "taros dral"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 60
talk taros dral
ask sensitive matters
expect GetJournalIndex DA_Mephala == 10
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex DA_Mephala == 40
bye
end

case da_mephala_poison
run
player->PositionCell 125 -40 49 0 "Balmora, Balyn Omarel's House"
wait 60
activate 0573FA5E
button 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex DA_Mephala == 50
end

case da_mephala_done
run
player->PositionCell -531 -450 -240 0 "Vivec, Arena Hidden Area"
until 600 "taros dral"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 60
talk taros dral
ask sensitive matters
bye
activate 05CD869D
until 300 GetJournalIndex DA_Mephala == 60
expect player->GetItemCount ring_khajiit_unique == 1
end
